            <ArticleTitle>[Heart transplantation conducted at the All-Union Research Center of Surgery (the first clinical experience)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>34-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors analyse experience in the first eight operations for orthotopic transplantation of the heart. Six patients were discharged from the clinic with good immediate results. Comparison of their own data with summarized results gained in other countries allowed the authors to define some specific problems which are of practical interest for clinics embarking on the clinical realization of the problem of heart transplantation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
